 but...!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-12-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ouqYEo26fJyLIZ9Ztt7jr9Q2ZYI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ouqYEo26fJyLIZ9Ztt7jr9Q2ZYI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/278378/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"6631818","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Episodio 45","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Christmas is coming soon, but Hanamichi Town isn’t feeling festive due to the impact of the Darkranda attacks. Uta and the others come up with some ideas to help Hanamichi Town feel Kirakilala.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tuKh3wXSrGRfNZYUW2Q1AqwDtHH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tuKh3wXSrGRfNZYUW2Q1AqwDtHH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/278378/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"6631819","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Episodio 46","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After watching the first sunrise of the new year from the hill by the Heart Tree, Uta and the gang get together at Tanaka’s house. At Tanaka’s suggestion, they all transform into Precures before beginning their New Year’s Party, but then the doorbell rings as if someone was waiting for that moment.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-01-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qYFXnGscZr61ShM2gUIFuJ0Asjb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qYFXnGscZr61ShM2gUIFuJ0Asjb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/278378/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"6631822","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Episodio 47","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As black petals flutter 